We obtain
\begin{eqnarray*}
	\sigma_\ell b'_{uv} &=& 	\begin{cases}
				-b^\ell_{x_\ell v_\ell} & \text{if $u =\mu_{x}(x)$}\\
				-b^\ell_{u_\ell x_\ell} & \text{if $v =\mu_{x}(x)$}\\
				b^\ell_{u_\ell v_\ell} + \frac{1}{2}(|b^\ell_{u_\ell x_\ell}|b^\ell_{x_\ell v_\ell} + b^\ell_{u_\ell x_\ell}|b_{x_\ell v_\ell}|) & \text{otherwise.}
