This is, up to a sign depending on the choice of sign-determining entry for the $\tilde{B}$-exchangeably connected component containing $x$, equal to the entry $\tilde{b}_{uv}$ of the exchange matrix $\tilde{B}$ of $\Sigma(\mu_x(F))$, as desired.
