$C(s)$ is the transfer function of the controller, $H(s)$ is the transfer function of the plant expressed by Eq. \ref{eq:transfer_laplace}, $R(s)$ is the laplace transformed $r(t)$, and $G(s)$ is the transfer function of the closed-loop, where

