\hline
\hline
Inactive Value & 0 & -1 & -1 & 1st $\sigma^\text{z}$ EV \\
\hline
Active Value & 1 & +1 & +1 & 2nd $\sigma^\text{z}$ EV \\
\hline
Variable & Bit & Spin & Qubit & Observable \\
\hline
Symbol & $x_i$ & $\sigma_i$ & $\hat{\sigma}_i$ & Symbol \\
\hline
