We address the following problem for undirected multi-graphs in this section.
\begin{problem}\label{prob: lambda+1 strcuture}
    Design a compact structure for storing and characterizing all $(\lambda+1)$ $(s,t)$-cuts.
\end{problem}
To solve Problem \ref{prob: lambda+1 strcuture}, we establish the following flow-based characterization of $(\lambda+1)$ $(s,t)$-cuts, which is of independent interest.
