Path $P_1$ can be obtained in ${\mathcal O}(m)$ time by using any traversal algorithm. 
In graph $G\setminus \{e_1\}$, we now obtain a new $(s,t)$-flow $f_1$ of value $\lambda-1$ from $f$. 
