Lorenz 3D & Chaotic & Chaotic & Chaotic~\cite{Ghys2013} \\
          & Periodic & Periodic & Periodic~\cite{Ghys2013} \\ \hline
Rossler 3D & Chaotic & Chaotic & Chaotic~\cite{ibrahim2018rossler} \\
